function onMessageSent(event) {
  const t0 = performance.now();
  deliverToRecipients(event);
  const latency = performance.now() - t0;
  recordMetric('e2e_latency_ms', latency);
}
```

## Follow-up Questions

- How would you model and test regional failover guarantees?
- What telemetry would you add to differentiate moderation latency from delivery latency?
